<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαιόομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαιεύομαι</span>
			, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of a midwife,
				<i>deliver</i> a woman, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				16.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.999c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμέας ἀφροσύνη μαιώσατο, τόλμα δ᾽
					ἔτικτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.80
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαιώσαντο νέον τόκον Εἰλείθυιαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.967
				</span></i>
			; of Hephaestus at the birth of Athena, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				19
			</span></i>: abs., <i>practise midwifery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.80
			</span></i>: in pass. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφ᾽ ἧς μαιωθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.4.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the mother,
				<i>to be delivered of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἣν . . οὐ μαιώσατο μήτηρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Coluth.
					181
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				4.437
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a
			nurse, <i>suckle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαζῷ τινα</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.186
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			 only late, of dawn <i>bringing forth</i> day, <i><span class="en">
				Jo.Gaz.
				1.58
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
